{"path":"regex/regex_token_iterator/operator_cmp","title":"std::regex_token_iterator<BidirIt,CharT,Traits>::operator==, operator!=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::regex_token_iterator&lt;BidirIt,CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>operator==, operator!=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/regex/regex_token_iterator/operator_cmp","section":"regex","kind":"page","summary":"Checks whether *this and other are equivalent.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> regex_token_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> regex_token_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(until C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks whether <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> are equivalent.\n</p><p>Two regex token iterators are equal if:\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">a)</span> They are both end-of-sequence iterators.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">b)</span> They are both suffix iterators and the suffixes are equal.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">c)</span> Neither of them is end-of-sequence or suffix iterator and:</div>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">position <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> other.<span class=\"me1\">position</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">N <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> other.<span class=\"me1\">N</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">subs <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> other.<span class=\"me1\">subs</span></span></code>\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</dd></dl>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Checks whether <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is <i>equal to</i> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Checks whether <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is <i>not equal to</i> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>.</div>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<p>The <code>!=</code> operator is <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons#Other_defaulted_comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <code>operator==</code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: Explain better. For example, <code>subs</code> is an exposition-only vector of matched sub-expressions. </div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another regex token iterator to compare to\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is <i>equal to</i> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is <i>not equal to</i> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"regex","title":"Regular expressions library (since C++11)"},{"path":"regex/regex_token_iterator","title":"std::regex_token_iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::regex_token_iterator<BidirIt,CharT,Traits>::operator==, operator!=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11, until C++20. Checks whether *this and other are equivalent."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if *this is equal to other, false otherwise."}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":147,"codeBlockCount":0}
